games=f'''<main id="main"><section class="wrap section" style="padding-top:0">{page_head("SHT Games / Original browser games","A little curiosity.<br>A different world.","Original games built to be played. Cooperation, tension and a few unexpected ways to spend the next ten minutes.")}<div class="game-banner"><div><div class="eyebrow">The independent games label</div><h2>Small games.<br>Made to play.</h2><p>SHT Games is the home for the full collection. Explore a game here, then head straight into its world.</p>{button('Visit SHT Games','https://shtgames.com/','light')}</div><img src="{ASSETS}wadi-rush.jpg" alt="Wadi Rush desert rally gameplay" width="640" height="360"></div>{toolbar(GAMES,["Co-op horror","Multiplayer","Co-op racing","Horror","Co-op adventure"])}{catalogue(GAMES)}<div class="note-box">Most games are best with a desktop keyboard and mouse. Light Fingers and Wadi Rush also support touch controls. Horror titles include darkness, pursuit or sudden scares. Hormuz Run is currently locked.</div><div class="section-top" style="margin-top:65px"><div><div class="eyebrow">From the original portfolio</div><h2>A few earlier experiments.</h2></div></div><div class="legacy-games"><a href="night-shift.html"><div>Night Shift<span>An interactive career archive</span></div>{icon('external')}</a><a href="prompt-runner.html"><div>Prompt Runner<span>An arcade journey through the work</span></div>{icon('external')}</a><a href="hangman.html"><div>Signal Break<span>A word game with a portfolio twist</span></div>{icon('external')}</a></div></section>{collab(title='An idea worth<br>playing with?',text='Interactive experiences, a brand partnership, or an original game. Let’s explore what it could become.')}</main>'''
